{"id":"20260830T053950.917737861Z-a7fd8fa2","time":"2026-08-30T05:39:50.917737861Z","session_id":"session-20260830T052251.276503861Z","task_id":"task-1788067371276752033","source":"claude","kind":"output","summary":"{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CeYPuSziYuSPBn6tSiUSk\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01HYPVW2FytBkgEtBCZG3BNR\",\"name\":\"mcp__sensei__awareness_edit_check\",\"input\":{\"file\":\"internal/report/report.go\",\"domain\":\"github.com/globulario/sensei-code\",\"proposed_content\":\"FromCapture derives the change shape from a candidate diff and the exact path set the capture measured. It fails closed when a diff entry names a path the capture did not measure, or a measured path no diff entry claims. Rename detection is on in the diff and off in the path set, so a rename is one Renamed FileChange consuming both exact paths. unquotePath undoes Git C-style quoting to bytes rather than through strconv.Unquote, so a non-UTF-8 pathname survives. FromDiff keeps its parser-only behaviour for existing consumers.\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":931,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":122169,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":931},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"afed017a-2ac9-46ae-8762-8a00ce03dcf8\",\"uuid\":\"c5acd8c8-bf19-44c6-aa5d-ec1c4a0bee0d\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-30T05:39:50.916Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011CeYPuS97sm9nqNy2Rb1Bj\",\"tool_use_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01HYPVW2FytBkgEtBCZG3BNR\",\"display_name\":\"Awareness Edit Check\",\"server_display_name\":\"sensei\"}]}","payload":{"stream":"stdout"}}
