{"id":"20260830T054230.105055433Z-71a6576b","time":"2026-08-30T05:42:30.105055433Z","session_id":"session-20260830T052251.276503861Z","task_id":"task-1788067371276752033","source":"reviewer","kind":"output","summary":"Add an exact-path-aware report constructor that combines a candidate diff’s presentation metadata with gitx.Capture.Paths as the authoritative pathname set. It must preserve one FileChange per logical change, including Added, Modified, Deleted, Renamed, and OldPath; a rename consumes both exact paths but remains one Renamed FileChange. Any mismatch between the diff structure and exact path set must fail closed. Keep FromDiff available for existing parser-only consumers. In the workflow, construct one Change from the final capture and reuse it for reporting and changedPaths, with deleted files still excluded from the post-change path list. Do not alter report disclaimers, governance counts, admission semantics, or unrelated workflow behavior. The task-scoped briefing must be retried once Sensei Code creates the task session; the current exact MCP error was: tool call error: tool call failed for `sensei/task_briefing`; Caused by: Mcp error: -32000: no task session exists in this repository.","payload":{"stream":"stderr"}}
